    "title": "Sen. Kendal Sacchieri celebrates SB 20's enforcement - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By The Purcell Register ,\n6 days ago State Senator Kendal Sacchieri today celebrated the early results of her landmark legislation, Senate Bill 20, the Secure Roads and Safe Trucking Act of 2025. The law requires commercial drivers in Oklahoma to demonstrate English proficiency and closes loopholes that previously allowed non-domiciled, non-resident drivers—many without legal status—to operate 18-wheelers on state highways. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
